    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Pain",
     "texto": [
      "**Mă doare capul** means \"my head hurts\"; literally, \"it hurts me, the head\". The person appears as the object (**mă**) and the body part as the subject."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Duration",
     "texto": [
      "For a symptom that continues, use the present + **de** + duration: **mă doare de două zile** (\"my head has hurt for two days\"), not a past tense as in English."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
